{"start": 0.15, "end": 4.67, "step": 41, "text": "It starts as Cincinnati's day. Gio Bernard goes 89 yards. 14–7."}, {"start": 8.62, "end": 12.19, "step": 89, "text": "Then Andy Dalton starts handing the game away."}, {"start": 12.61, "end": 16.49, "step": 106, "text": "Carolina takes over. Cam Newton runs it in. 24–17."}, {"start": 17.38, "end": 20.94, "step": 131, "text": "Twelve minutes left, and Cincinnati claws back. 24–24."}, {"start": 22.39, "end": 26.91, "step": 149, "text": "Carolina pulls ahead again, 31–24. Under five minutes to save it..."}, {"start": 29.22, "end": 32.46, "step": 150, "text": "...and Cincinnati answers in one breath. 31–31."}, {"start": 35.47, "end": 40.15, "step": 161, "text": "Two minutes left. Nugent puts the Bengals up 34–31. It should be over."}, {"start": 40.3, "end": 44.82, "step": 177, "text": "Five seconds left, down three. One kick to save Carolina. 34–34."}, {"start": 45.76, "end": 49.96, "step": 208, "text": "Overtime. Down three, two minutes left, Gano answers again. 37–37."}, {"start": 51.31, "end": 54.51, "step": 219, "text": "Two seconds left. One kick to win it..."}, {"start": 54.66, "end": 57.9, "step": 219, "text": "Wide right. After all that, nobody wins."}], "files": {"video": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_excite_60_video.mp4", "game": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_excite_60_game.m4a", "song": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_excite_60_song.m4a"}, "story": "Every swing lands when the music does. A tie is a held breath, not a peak.", "story_title": "Neither side gives in", "why_song": "Vivaldi's Winter hammers out accent after accent. Every big swing in this game lands on one of them, and it eases off while the game holds its breath.", "curve": [0.0, 0.076, 0.179, 0.28, 0.358, 0.403, 0.417, 0.413, 0.415, 0.441, 0.491, 0.55, 0.598, 0.618, 0.604, 0.559, 0.495, 